            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lynda Tombrella"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I lived in Tunisia for a couple of years and was thankful to find this recipe! It brings back so many memories and now some of my attempts to cook Tunisian food will taste more authentic. I did \"cheat\" however, and used a blender instead of a mortar and pestle. I added some water and olive oil to make sure it was the right consistency. Thanks for sharing this recipe!",
